WEBVTT

01:36.310 --> 01:40.960
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.190 --> 01:43.850
[Episode 21]

01:55.550 --> 01:57.190
Shao Liulei, how dare you!

01:58.560 --> 01:59.710
I will kill you!

02:00.120 --> 02:02.350
Mr. Shao, why did you do this?

02:02.790 --> 02:03.400
Boy.

02:05.960 --> 02:08.350
If Crazy Yan really sent you to find me,

02:08.930 --> 02:10.960
he'd surely be protecting you in secret.

02:10.960 --> 02:12.280
But when this girl
tried to steal the pill,

02:12.280 --> 02:13.610
he still didn't show up.

02:13.750 --> 02:15.210
This proves you're lying.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.430
The moment

02:16.430 --> 02:18.500
you claimed
that Crazy Yan felt guilty toward me,

02:18.500 --> 02:19.829
you gave yourself away.

02:20.190 --> 02:21.630
He abducted me for 10 years,

02:21.630 --> 02:23.630
using every cruel method imaginable on me.

02:23.630 --> 02:25.510
How could he possibly feel guilty?

02:25.510 --> 02:28.450
So Shao Liulei was testing me
from the very beginning.

02:28.450 --> 02:30.910
Never thought
he'd been scheming all along.

02:31.320 --> 02:33.050
What's even more ridiculous is

02:33.240 --> 02:35.500
that you want to take this Infinite Pill.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.190
Since you know

02:38.390 --> 02:40.630
he forced me to take
half of the Yang pill,

02:40.630 --> 02:42.710
in no case would he
leave the Yin pill behind.

02:42.710 --> 02:45.630
This last pill is the half Yang pill.

02:46.430 --> 02:47.360
Once you take it,

02:47.750 --> 02:49.750
you'll end up with the same fate as me,

02:49.750 --> 02:51.079
being tortured by the primal Yang energy.

02:51.079 --> 02:52.360
That's worse than death.

02:52.360 --> 02:54.160
You're not his younger brother.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.079
You lied to me!

03:03.280 --> 03:05.610
I hate being deceived more than anything.

03:07.510 --> 03:10.790
You all say I betrayed them
to help Crazy Yan.

03:12.280 --> 03:14.230
But it was actually Zhu the Great King

03:14.230 --> 03:16.630
using me as a shield
against his fatal move.

03:19.460 --> 03:20.590
He deceived me, too.

03:22.460 --> 03:23.150
He lied to me

03:23.150 --> 03:26.710
that the Long River's waterways
would see me as a hero.

03:27.350 --> 03:29.480
But after suffering for so many years,

03:29.640 --> 03:30.840
I escaped only to hear

03:32.079 --> 03:34.010
that you all consider me a traitor.

03:34.710 --> 03:35.640
Why did I escape?

03:36.150 --> 03:37.280
Was it really to offer this elixir

03:37.280 --> 03:38.480
to Zhu the Great King?

03:41.190 --> 03:42.560
I want him to swallow it.

03:44.940 --> 03:46.150
I want him to suffer

03:46.630 --> 03:49.090
from the primal Yang energy every day
just like me.

03:49.090 --> 03:51.290
I'll make all of you who once deceived me

03:51.310 --> 03:52.310
taste every bit

03:52.910 --> 03:56.910
of the suffering I've endured!

04:09.950 --> 04:13.120
You attacked me from behind when I was
suffering from the primal Yang energy.

04:13.120 --> 04:16.390
Guess what I most want to do now.

04:17.600 --> 04:18.800
What do you want to do?

04:24.720 --> 04:26.750
My body is about to burst
due to the primal Yang energy.

04:26.750 --> 04:28.890
I need to balance Yin and Yang, of course.

04:28.890 --> 04:30.950
They told me that in Yunxia Mountain,

04:31.210 --> 04:33.140
there are spiritual insects
used to make Yin pills.

04:33.140 --> 04:35.510
Taking them would relieve my suffering.

04:36.350 --> 04:39.010
But I've searched for so long
and found nothing.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.630
All liars!

04:41.560 --> 04:44.830
Now I'll use you to relieve my pain.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.850
Do you know who I am?

04:48.150 --> 04:48.760
I know.

04:50.630 --> 04:51.690
A beautiful woman.

04:52.280 --> 04:54.990
I work for Mr. Liu, Liu Suifeng.

04:56.310 --> 04:57.909
If you dare lay a finger on me,

04:57.950 --> 05:01.610
my master will make you suffer
a hundred times more than you do now.

05:03.630 --> 05:05.190
Even if what you say is true,

05:05.940 --> 05:08.450
do you think I'd care about it?

05:14.310 --> 05:17.950
You look so beautiful when you're angry.

05:27.290 --> 05:28.320
Don't you dare!

05:31.530 --> 05:32.490
Shao Liulei,

05:33.040 --> 05:34.310
you'll regret this.

05:57.950 --> 05:58.720
Boy,

05:59.290 --> 06:00.530
you're way too nice.

06:01.870 --> 06:02.630
Mr. Shao,

06:03.520 --> 06:04.800
what makes us human

06:06.630 --> 06:08.560
is that we must have some dignity.

06:17.000 --> 06:17.870
Dignity?

06:19.270 --> 06:21.400
Who are you to talk to me about dignity?

06:25.350 --> 06:28.240
Do you know what I've been through
these past ten years?

06:28.240 --> 06:30.500
I've lived like neither human nor ghost,

06:30.970 --> 06:32.320
worse off than a rat!

06:33.260 --> 06:35.190
Have you ever suffered like I have?

06:35.380 --> 06:37.180
Not having experienced my pain,

06:37.950 --> 06:40.010
how dare you talk to me about dignity?

06:44.720 --> 06:46.390
Since you're so righteous,

06:47.310 --> 06:48.640
swallow this Yang pill.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.770
Then you'll end up just like me.

06:51.360 --> 06:54.020
I have Crazy Yan's vital energy
to keep me alive.

06:54.070 --> 06:55.070
But you don't.

06:56.020 --> 06:58.550
You'll be tortured to death
within two hours.

06:58.950 --> 07:00.350
But you can learn from me.

07:01.510 --> 07:02.480
Use this girl

07:02.830 --> 07:04.560
to ease your pain for a few days.

07:05.160 --> 07:07.510
Then let me see

07:08.390 --> 07:11.310
what you'll choose between your life

07:12.200 --> 07:13.200
and your dignity.

07:24.160 --> 07:24.920
Boy,

07:25.390 --> 07:27.360
if death comes after the sexual pleasure,

07:27.360 --> 07:28.760
I'd call it a good ending.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.800
I've sealed this girl's pressure points

07:31.800 --> 07:32.680
and yours, too.

07:33.430 --> 07:36.000
I'll throw both of you
to the bottom of the valley.

07:36.000 --> 07:36.800
By then,

07:37.430 --> 07:39.240
an antidote at your disposal

07:39.530 --> 07:41.040
will be lying right beside you.

07:41.040 --> 07:41.530
You...

07:41.560 --> 07:42.760
What will you choose?

07:47.170 --> 07:47.800
To live

07:49.310 --> 07:49.950
or to die?

07:51.310 --> 07:52.000
To live

07:53.240 --> 07:53.870
or to die?

07:55.120 --> 07:55.750
To live

07:57.270 --> 07:57.920
or to die?

08:15.940 --> 08:17.000
Zhu the Great King,

08:17.480 --> 08:19.410
I haven't gotten even with you yet.

08:20.070 --> 08:23.400
The Yang pill is gone,
and I'll get you another poisonous pill.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.670
I must have my revenge.

08:49.550 --> 08:51.000
You took that pill.

08:51.550 --> 08:52.720
A-Are you alright?

08:53.680 --> 08:54.480
Song Mingzhu,

08:55.000 --> 08:56.900
I'll never forgive you
for massacring my family.

08:56.900 --> 08:59.300
If you want to live,
get the hell out of here.

08:59.660 --> 09:01.190
Unlock my pressure points.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.500
I can help you heal.

09:02.500 --> 09:03.190
Shut up!

09:10.240 --> 09:11.040
Xiao Qiushui.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.440
Now you can kill me if you want.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.040
I have no strength to resist.

09:15.250 --> 09:16.380
Even if you saved me,

09:17.390 --> 09:18.150
next time,

09:19.080 --> 09:20.320
I'd still fight you with all my might

09:20.320 --> 09:21.080
for my master

09:21.840 --> 09:22.840
and show no mercy.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.810
I can't unlock your pressure points.

09:26.960 --> 09:29.080
I can't stop the pill
from taking effect on me.

09:29.080 --> 09:29.750
Once the time's up,

09:29.750 --> 09:31.470
your pressure points will be unlocked.

09:31.470 --> 09:32.240
Listen,

09:32.240 --> 09:34.640
get the hell
as far away from me as possible!

11:32.730 --> 11:34.690
My body is about to burst
due to the primal Yang energy.

11:34.690 --> 11:36.940
I need to balance Yin and Yang, of course.

11:36.940 --> 11:39.000
They told me that in Yunxia Mountain,

11:39.100 --> 11:41.070
there are spiritual insects
used to make Yin pills.

11:41.070 --> 11:43.500
Taking them would relieve my suffering.

11:50.090 --> 11:50.900
Snake venom.

11:51.830 --> 11:54.030
Could it be that the white snake's venom

11:54.100 --> 11:57.160
is the ingredient
for the Yin pill of the Infinite Pill?

12:18.430 --> 12:20.410
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

12:20.430 --> 12:22.820
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

12:22.850 --> 12:26.450
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

12:26.750 --> 12:28.710
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

12:28.730 --> 12:30.750
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

12:30.770 --> 12:33.800
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

12:34.060 --> 12:36.180
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

12:36.200 --> 12:37.920
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

12:37.940 --> 12:41.420
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

12:41.440 --> 12:43.170
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

12:43.190 --> 12:45.170
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

12:45.190 --> 12:52.090
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

12:57.470 --> 12:59.590
♪ The violent storms ♪

13:01.140 --> 13:04.130
♪ Thousands of turbid waves ♪

13:04.980 --> 13:06.570
♪ Tread on through till the break of day ♪

13:06.600 --> 13:09.910
♪ I'm ready to go with you ♪

13:09.210 --> 13:10.180
My internal energy is rising.

13:09.960 --> 13:11.440
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

13:10.660 --> 13:12.030
The rampant yang energy has been resolved.

13:11.460 --> 13:13.370
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

13:12.730 --> 13:14.450
Could I have gained
60 years' worth of martial power?

13:13.490 --> 13:20.550
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

13:24.810 --> 13:25.610
Xiao Qiushui,

13:26.210 --> 13:28.260
you're really different from others.

13:28.260 --> 13:29.140
If it were me,

13:30.060 --> 13:32.320
as long as I could survive
a few more days,

13:32.450 --> 13:34.780
I wouldn't care about anyone else's life.

13:37.210 --> 13:37.900
Thanks.

13:41.460 --> 13:42.120
Stop there.

13:44.610 --> 13:46.270
You people from the Power Gang

13:46.610 --> 13:48.210
truly have no conscience.

13:50.900 --> 13:52.300
Song Mingzhu, answer me.

13:54.020 --> 13:55.680
Where are my parents' bodies?

13:56.360 --> 13:57.690
You saved my life today.

13:58.060 --> 13:59.610
So I'll tell you honestly.

14:00.660 --> 14:01.330
Your parents' bodies

14:01.330 --> 14:02.930
were taken away by my master.

14:03.020 --> 14:04.280
But I really don't know

14:04.480 --> 14:05.540
where he sent them.

14:05.930 --> 14:07.390
As someone so close to him,

14:07.420 --> 14:08.570
how could you not know?

14:08.570 --> 14:10.650
My master only mentioned
he had leads to follow.

14:10.650 --> 14:12.180
How could I dare to ask more?

14:21.380 --> 14:22.900
You'd better not be lying.

14:26.000 --> 14:28.000
I should've killed you with one blow

14:28.610 --> 14:29.770
and sent your bodies

14:30.490 --> 14:32.180
one by one to the Sword Manor

14:32.990 --> 14:35.790
to avenge
those of the Xiao family who died in vain.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.510
Go tell Liu Suifeng

14:39.450 --> 14:40.650
and that Li Chenzhou.

14:41.960 --> 14:44.220
For the blood debts your Power Gang owes,

14:44.470 --> 14:46.190
I will settle them one by one.

14:57.190 --> 15:00.250
Xiao Qiushui has actually absorbed
the Infinite Pill.

15:01.350 --> 15:02.990
Isn't Master in danger then?

15:04.060 --> 15:05.870
Have all the Power Gang members left?

15:05.870 --> 15:07.780
Is this place safe now?

15:08.260 --> 15:10.830
Roushui and the others are
dealing with the Power Gang.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.690
Go ahead with what you want to say.

15:16.660 --> 15:17.710
I risked my life

15:18.140 --> 15:19.670
to seize this Infinite Pill

15:21.070 --> 15:22.730
just to present it to the King.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.270
You've done well.

15:35.400 --> 15:38.450
I will tell the Heavenly King
about your dedication.

15:59.920 --> 16:01.640
Long time no see, Kang Chuyu.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.090
Xiao Qiushui?

16:03.920 --> 16:05.590
What are you doing here,
you good-for-nothing?

16:05.590 --> 16:06.370
Take a guess.

16:08.200 --> 16:09.720
I have serious matters to attend to.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.920
If you wish to die,
I'll come kill you later.

16:11.920 --> 16:14.050
I'm afraid you won't be leaving today.

16:16.080 --> 16:17.480
You're asking for death.

16:33.190 --> 16:36.650
Didn't expect this man
to have such powerful internal energy.

16:47.120 --> 16:47.850
Kang Chuyu.

16:50.480 --> 16:53.210
You betrayed your friends,
against all loyalty.

16:53.610 --> 16:56.340
You slaughtered the innocent,
against all morality.

16:56.340 --> 16:58.600
You deserve to die the most tragic death!

16:59.050 --> 16:59.730
Today,

17:00.730 --> 17:02.400
I will make you pay for the deaths

17:02.400 --> 17:04.400
of over 100 people in my Xiao family!

17:27.440 --> 17:28.200
Tang Rou,

17:29.160 --> 17:30.120
did you see that?

17:31.210 --> 17:33.670
I finally made Kang Chuyu pay
for your death.

17:34.950 --> 17:35.620
Father,

17:37.050 --> 17:37.640
Mother,

17:38.680 --> 17:40.540
for the blood debts of our family,

17:41.500 --> 17:43.500
I will settle them one by one.

18:25.870 --> 18:27.330
Now that Zhu the Great King knows

18:27.330 --> 18:29.760
that we're enemies
of the Shaolin and Wudang Sects,

18:29.760 --> 18:33.040
you're still causing trouble everywhere
during this time,

18:33.040 --> 18:35.170
hampering our gang's every move.

18:35.810 --> 18:37.610
How dare you show your face here?

18:37.920 --> 18:39.720
I know my sins are unforgivable.

18:40.850 --> 18:43.010
But I submit myself
to the Chief's judgment.

18:43.010 --> 18:45.140
I only want the Chief to give me a chance

18:45.290 --> 18:46.420
to atone for my sins.

18:46.770 --> 18:48.880
The Chief already gave you a chance before

18:48.880 --> 18:49.880
and let you leave.

18:50.520 --> 18:51.910
But you chose to stay.

18:52.680 --> 18:54.530
Since you want this opportunity,

18:54.530 --> 18:55.360
the Chief said

18:56.160 --> 18:57.620
you must seek it yourself.

18:58.290 --> 18:59.890
Is this what the Chief means?

19:03.610 --> 19:04.410
I understand.

19:06.490 --> 19:09.550
I'll set out for Wudang Sect now
to beg for forgiveness.

19:18.640 --> 19:24.170
I never thought you'd be the one
to see me off in the end.

19:25.720 --> 19:26.450
Liu Suifeng,

19:27.010 --> 19:28.680
are you still suspecting

19:29.370 --> 19:32.650
that I sent someone
to impersonate the Chief to frame you?

19:34.770 --> 19:35.700
No way it was you.

19:38.120 --> 19:39.650
You don't have the audacity

19:41.290 --> 19:43.490
to have someone impersonate the Chief.

19:49.760 --> 19:51.020
Put these on yourself.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.450
Liu Suifeng,

20:11.160 --> 20:11.770
wake up!

20:12.720 --> 20:14.490
Don't you dare die on the way.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.650
It'd mess up my mission.

20:23.920 --> 20:26.400
The Chief wants me
to reach the Wudang Sect alive.

20:26.400 --> 20:28.000
And I certainly will make it.

21:20.040 --> 21:21.840
Greetings from the Wudang Sect.

21:28.530 --> 21:30.720
Our sect leader sent us here
to receive you.

21:30.720 --> 21:32.780
Please hand this criminal over to us.

21:32.960 --> 21:33.960
Greetings, sirs.

21:34.330 --> 21:36.010
When was this arrangement made?

21:36.010 --> 21:37.270
I've never heard of it.

21:40.720 --> 21:43.090
This is a letter from our sect leader.

21:41.180 --> 21:42.810
[To the Power Gang]

21:44.030 --> 21:46.090
He was concerned
about your fatigue from the long journey.

21:46.090 --> 21:47.750
Since there's still some distance
to the Wudang Sect,

21:47.750 --> 21:49.410
he ordered us to come meet you.

21:50.360 --> 21:51.090
This is true.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.330
Judging by the handwriting,

21:52.330 --> 21:55.400
this is indeed
the Wudang Sect's official correspondence.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.010
You two must be tired
from your journey north.

21:57.010 --> 21:58.330
You could rest nearby.

21:58.810 --> 22:00.740
We'll take the criminal from here.

22:13.360 --> 22:13.960
Wait.

22:15.910 --> 22:18.010
We only briefly informed the Wudang Sect

22:18.010 --> 22:19.880
that we'd be escorting Liu Suifeng
to face punishment.

22:19.880 --> 22:22.320
How did you know
we were traveling north?

22:23.120 --> 22:24.520
Just a slip of the tongue.

22:24.640 --> 22:26.530
Blade King, please don't overthink it.

22:26.530 --> 22:28.290
We've been traveling discreetly.

22:28.290 --> 22:29.820
We should have headed east.

22:30.460 --> 22:31.790
But to avoid attention,

22:31.810 --> 22:33.680
we deliberately detoured
to the southern stronghold

22:33.680 --> 22:35.680
and then headed north to the Wudang Sect.

22:35.680 --> 22:37.490
How could you possibly know about it?

22:37.490 --> 22:38.590
Could it be that someone

22:38.590 --> 22:40.790
leaked our itinerary to you in advance?

22:47.200 --> 22:47.810
Tell me

22:48.810 --> 22:49.920
who sent you here.

23:01.250 --> 23:02.010
You must have

23:02.660 --> 23:04.620
stolen our correspondence

23:05.360 --> 23:06.660
and rushed to forge this letter, right?

23:06.660 --> 23:07.200
Move!

24:02.850 --> 24:03.530
Chieftess?

24:06.220 --> 24:06.880
Chieftess.

24:10.650 --> 24:12.090
We fell into their trap.

24:12.640 --> 24:14.300
Thankfully, you came to help.

24:14.750 --> 24:16.360
Thank you for your help, Chieftess.

24:16.360 --> 24:18.160
These people have finally shown

24:18.270 --> 24:19.530
their sly true colors.

24:21.160 --> 24:22.280
Take them back for interrogation.

24:22.280 --> 24:22.800
Yes.

24:23.240 --> 24:25.440
Leave Liu Suifeng to me.

24:43.200 --> 24:45.260
Even though you did something wrong,

24:45.490 --> 24:47.350
he still can't bear to let you die.

24:50.170 --> 24:51.990
[15 years ago]

24:50.500 --> 24:51.170
Stop there!

24:51.510 --> 24:52.650
You brat! Stop there!

24:52.650 --> 24:53.420
Stop!

24:54.210 --> 24:55.010
Stop running!

24:57.430 --> 24:58.760
I'll kill you!

24:59.030 --> 24:59.470
Hey..

24:59.890 --> 25:01.180
How dare you flee?

25:01.210 --> 25:02.270
You won't get away!

25:02.400 --> 25:03.010
I'll

25:03.700 --> 25:04.700
beat you to death!

25:32.710 --> 25:34.270
Why did you save me?

25:35.800 --> 25:36.910
Why did I save you?

25:38.200 --> 25:39.400
Let me think about it.

25:39.940 --> 25:40.940
You saved my life.

25:41.830 --> 25:43.960
In return, I'll help you kill a person.

25:47.980 --> 25:49.040
That doesn't sound

25:50.090 --> 25:51.250
very appealing.

25:51.640 --> 25:53.800
Then I'll give my life to you.

25:55.760 --> 25:58.160
Give your life to me?
That's not necessary.

25:59.680 --> 26:01.570
I like the coldness in your eyes.

26:05.570 --> 26:08.330
It would be a waste for you to die here.

26:14.280 --> 26:14.970
Take this.

26:39.750 --> 26:41.640
You've been following me all the way.

26:41.640 --> 26:42.680
What's wrong?

26:42.890 --> 26:44.130
My life is yours now.

26:44.360 --> 26:46.890
Where else could I go
if I'm not following you?

26:48.260 --> 26:50.790
But you've been tortured
to a terrible state.

26:51.160 --> 26:53.490
What's the point of keeping you around us?

26:53.570 --> 26:55.970
If I recover,
I can kill and plunder for you.

26:56.060 --> 26:58.300
If not, I can chop wood and lead horses.

26:58.740 --> 27:00.200
I can be useful either way.

27:09.740 --> 27:11.410
Things have come to this point,

27:11.410 --> 27:13.650
yet the Chief still hasn't abandoned me.

27:13.650 --> 27:15.180
I felt something on the way.

27:15.550 --> 27:18.080
I just didn't know
the Chief's detailed plan.

27:18.270 --> 27:19.730
So I could only play along.

27:21.290 --> 27:22.800
So you had noticed that it was

27:22.800 --> 27:25.530
Chenzhou's plan
to lure the snake out of its hole.

27:31.520 --> 27:33.870
If the Chief wants me to sacrifice myself

27:34.890 --> 27:37.820
to appease the wrath
of the Shaolin and Wudang Sects,

27:39.110 --> 27:40.910
I would do so without complaint.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.010
Suifeng,

27:43.770 --> 27:46.530
both Chenzhou and I
have long placed our trust in you.

27:46.530 --> 27:49.390
We know that even if everyone
in our gang betrays us,

27:49.530 --> 27:50.460
you never would.

27:51.490 --> 27:53.720
Our gang has made many enemies
over the years.

27:53.720 --> 27:55.780
Our previous plans were all exposed.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.920
Chenzhou thought

27:57.400 --> 28:00.290
that there must be
spies and moles planted within our gang.

28:00.290 --> 28:01.750
If we don't get rid of them,

28:02.200 --> 28:04.260
there will never be peace in our gang.

28:04.850 --> 28:06.640
So we utilized the case

28:06.640 --> 28:08.680
of you killing Tianzheng and Taichan

28:08.680 --> 28:10.280
to make a fuss and set up a trap

28:10.330 --> 28:11.680
to root out these spies.

28:13.120 --> 28:14.920
The Chief is truly far-sighted.

28:16.770 --> 28:17.640
I owe my life

28:18.160 --> 28:19.810
to you and the Chief.

28:21.050 --> 28:24.110
If there ever comes a day
when you truly lose trust in me,

28:24.200 --> 28:26.440
I'll literally end up
like a walking corpse.

28:26.440 --> 28:28.370
I'd rather die than live like that.

28:28.840 --> 28:30.040
You should rest here.

28:30.700 --> 28:32.850
I'll go back
to interrogate those traitors.

28:32.850 --> 28:36.050
If there are any updates,
I'll send someone to inform you.

29:03.960 --> 29:04.490
Master.

29:07.720 --> 29:09.250
It's getting cold at night.

29:09.370 --> 29:11.360
Please take care and rest well, Master.

29:11.360 --> 29:12.050
I'm fine.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.520
I heard you got into trouble,

29:15.830 --> 29:16.960
and I was so worried.

29:17.490 --> 29:18.890
My issue's been settled.

29:19.120 --> 29:20.720
The Chief's no longer blaming me.

29:20.720 --> 29:22.720
Master, if you leave the Power Gang,

29:23.360 --> 29:24.400
I, the Red Phoenix,

29:24.400 --> 29:26.240
will have no attachment to it either.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.170
While I was away,

29:28.330 --> 29:30.730
how were things going
with the Xiao family?

29:31.960 --> 29:33.160
Don't worry, Master.

29:33.400 --> 29:35.920
Xiao Yiren's been sending
recruitment invitations all over Jindu,

29:35.920 --> 29:37.920
trying to rebuild the Huanhua Sect,

29:38.050 --> 29:40.440
but no one's interested.
They're getting nowhere.

29:40.440 --> 29:42.090
Those small sects
that used to follow the Xiao family

29:42.090 --> 29:43.400
have turned against them, too.

29:43.400 --> 29:45.960
Xiao Yiren is headstrong and arrogant,

29:46.640 --> 29:48.170
obsessed with being a hero.

29:48.510 --> 29:51.710
But he only cares about maintaining
a hollow reputation.

29:52.010 --> 29:53.670
He can't cause us any trouble.

29:56.140 --> 29:57.570
But that Xiao Qiushui...

29:58.240 --> 29:59.170
Someone like him

29:59.640 --> 30:01.810
is lucky just to survive
in the martial world.

30:01.810 --> 30:03.400
He doesn't deserve your attention, Master.

30:03.400 --> 30:06.200
Do you genuinely think
he's not worth mentioning,

30:07.160 --> 30:09.050
or are you trying to protect him?

30:10.570 --> 30:12.300
Please speak plainly, Master.

30:13.070 --> 30:15.130
I can tolerate occasional failures,

30:15.200 --> 30:16.530
but you should know well

30:17.650 --> 30:19.710
about the consequences of betrayal.

30:21.400 --> 30:22.400
I dare not do that.

30:23.010 --> 30:25.290
I will never betray you
in my life, Master.

30:25.290 --> 30:26.720
If you suspect me,

30:28.610 --> 30:30.010
you can kill me right now.

30:33.840 --> 30:35.970
I suppose you wouldn't dare betray me.

30:36.200 --> 30:39.000
You didn't mention a word
about the Infinite Pill.

30:39.570 --> 30:41.050
Did something go wrong?

30:43.680 --> 30:44.340
Where is it?

30:46.010 --> 30:47.870
One was swallowed by Shao Liulei.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.010
And the other one

30:51.360 --> 30:53.690
was grabbed by the Flame Lord, Cai Qishen.

30:53.760 --> 30:55.800
Shao Liulei's martial arts are
stronger than mine.

30:55.800 --> 30:57.060
I went through great trouble

30:57.060 --> 30:58.590
just to escape and survive.

31:00.920 --> 31:02.180
If this happens again,

31:03.360 --> 31:04.820
don't bother coming back.

31:06.850 --> 31:07.850
You may leave now.

31:08.330 --> 31:09.060
Yes, Master.

31:31.550 --> 31:33.750
Even if I'm willing to die for my master,

31:33.910 --> 31:36.830
it didn't move him at all.

31:39.860 --> 31:41.580
Song Mingzhu,

31:42.310 --> 31:44.440
what are you still fantasizing about?

31:47.610 --> 31:49.410
I'm satisfied with just staying

31:50.290 --> 31:51.290
by Master's side.

32:03.880 --> 32:05.960
These days, the Chieftess and I

32:05.960 --> 32:08.950
have been secretly investigating clues
about this falconry whistle.

32:08.950 --> 32:11.610
We only know it's a mysterious group
backed up by the Northern Wasteland,

32:11.610 --> 32:15.920
deliberately planted in the martial world
to work for the Northern Wasteland.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.770
I always use one blade for one kill.

32:17.770 --> 32:19.010
These are for you.

32:20.290 --> 32:21.880
Confess or choose a blade.

32:21.970 --> 32:22.840
It's up to you.

32:35.990 --> 32:38.880
The Misery Pill from the Death Beetle is
incredibly powerful.

32:38.880 --> 32:41.150
If you don't reveal
who's behind this falconry whistle now,

32:41.150 --> 32:43.010
I'll let it roam inside your body.

32:43.120 --> 32:45.530
By day, you'll suffer unbearable itching,
like being tortured by numerous ants.

32:45.530 --> 32:47.880
At night, you'll endure excruciating pain,
like being skinned alive.

32:47.880 --> 32:49.010
You'll keep begging

32:49.010 --> 32:49.880
for relief.

32:50.200 --> 32:53.010
I only know the leaders met
at Qingfeng Mansion.

32:55.050 --> 33:00.010
[Qingfeng Mansion]

33:28.290 --> 33:29.850
Fire King, you made one wrong move,

33:29.850 --> 33:31.160
then everything went wrong.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.400
So you ended up here.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.900
You and I are old acquaintances.

33:39.900 --> 33:42.970
We've always been on good terms
in the gang and never fought before.

33:42.970 --> 33:43.810
I've prepared a blade

33:43.810 --> 33:45.340
for each of you Seven Kings.

33:45.490 --> 33:47.490
Take your pick.

33:55.940 --> 33:58.130
Li Chenzhou must be out of his mind,

33:59.010 --> 34:01.200
sending you over to kill me.

34:01.530 --> 34:02.460
That's not true.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.360
I just want you to tell me

34:04.380 --> 34:06.050
who's behind this falconry whistle.

34:06.050 --> 34:07.970
As for whether we should
kill you, Fire King,

34:07.970 --> 34:08.900
it's not up to me.

34:16.460 --> 34:17.790
You traitor to the gang,

34:17.909 --> 34:19.440
you have nowhere to escape.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.639
This is the Marching Pill formula

34:35.639 --> 34:37.239
found in your mansion.

34:39.699 --> 34:41.230
And that falconry whistle.

34:41.679 --> 34:45.830
They're enough to prove you betrayed us
and colluded with the Northern Wasteland.

34:45.830 --> 34:47.360
What else do you have to say?

34:48.500 --> 34:50.170
Since you have figured it out,

34:51.120 --> 34:53.010
I need to say no more.

34:53.679 --> 34:54.480
That's right.

34:54.969 --> 34:57.490
We've long been Falconry Whistle members.

34:59.160 --> 34:59.840
Fire King,

35:00.330 --> 35:01.860
you're an elder of our gang.

35:02.050 --> 35:04.110
I'll give you a chance to make amends.

35:04.140 --> 35:06.220
Tell us honestly who your superior is

35:06.860 --> 35:10.660
and if there are others in the gang
working for the Falconry Whistle.

35:13.480 --> 35:17.270
The Falconry Whistle's rise is
unstoppable.

35:19.050 --> 35:21.490
It's too late for you to do anything!

35:21.640 --> 35:22.160
Fine.

35:22.730 --> 35:23.790
Then let me ask you.

35:24.280 --> 35:26.370
Were you involved in the massacre

35:28.070 --> 35:29.800
of the Baicao Valley back then?

35:31.200 --> 35:33.680
I've been living
as quite a figure for all my life.

35:33.680 --> 35:35.640
If I did it, I would never deny it.

35:35.640 --> 35:38.090
If I didn't do it,
in no case would I admit it.

35:40.110 --> 35:43.840
I stole that formula
from the Diancang Sect.

35:44.800 --> 35:47.090
As for this Baicao Valley,

35:48.090 --> 35:49.490
I know nothing about it.

35:50.970 --> 35:53.970
You, Liu Suifeng,
just killed Tianzheng and Taichan,

35:54.610 --> 35:56.570
causing outrage
throughout the martial world.

35:56.570 --> 35:59.200
How dare you still keep him by your side?

36:01.200 --> 36:05.610
The Power Gang's days are numbered,
I guess.

36:05.970 --> 36:07.800
As for everything I've done,

36:08.120 --> 36:10.050
it was all for long-term planning.

36:10.610 --> 36:13.570
You're thinking too highly of yourselves.

36:13.890 --> 36:16.020
You think you're the only ones who know

36:16.490 --> 36:20.240
what's inside that Hero Command Token?

36:21.490 --> 36:23.090
Still showing no remorse, you'll be

36:23.090 --> 36:25.020
dealt with under the gang's rules!

36:26.970 --> 36:29.010
I've long anticipated this day.

36:29.760 --> 36:30.970
Back then,

36:31.120 --> 36:34.320
to prevent wars
among the Eight Kings, Li Chenzhou

36:34.570 --> 36:35.410
made us take

36:35.570 --> 36:38.160
the Misery Pills made from our own blood.

36:39.010 --> 36:43.800
Now I've mastered
the foreign Vein Melting Technique

36:44.300 --> 36:47.380
and have already
purged the poison from my veins.

36:48.410 --> 36:52.200
If they kill me, the poison will act up,

36:53.050 --> 36:55.010
and they can only see themselves die.

36:55.010 --> 36:58.570
But I can kill them!

37:28.840 --> 37:30.260
The Death Beetle has
come out of his body.

37:30.260 --> 37:32.800
The restriction effect of the Misery Pill
in the Fire King's body is removed.

37:32.800 --> 37:34.800
He is no longer one of the Eight Kings.

37:34.800 --> 37:36.000
We can attack him now.

37:38.170 --> 37:42.290
I'll take you to hell with me!

37:42.630 --> 37:45.580
I'll use this Flame Palm
I've hidden for a decade

37:45.930 --> 37:48.160
to burn you all to ashes!

37:54.320 --> 37:55.980
This blade is called Piercer.

37:55.980 --> 37:57.980
Your death honors its name.

38:15.800 --> 38:17.460
I feel sorry for you, Suifeng.

38:18.840 --> 38:20.500
He's not the foe you're after.

38:21.170 --> 38:23.770
You will have to wait again
to get your revenge.

38:27.400 --> 38:31.160
At least we retrieved the formula
before it fell into the wrong hands.

38:31.160 --> 38:34.420
This should bring some peace
to the souls of Baicao Valley.

38:36.680 --> 38:39.200
But the Fire King was determined to die.

38:39.930 --> 38:42.460
The Falconry Whistle's spies
and their plans

38:43.320 --> 38:45.250
will need further investigation.

38:47.570 --> 38:49.200
The Fire King refused to confess
till his death.

38:49.200 --> 38:51.640
It shows how far-reaching
the Falconry Whistle's schemes are.

38:51.640 --> 38:54.280
They tricked Suifeng into killing
Tianzheng and Taichan,

38:54.280 --> 38:56.490
creating conflicts between us
and the Shaolin and Wudang Sects

38:56.490 --> 38:59.220
as well as internal strife
within the Power Gang.

38:59.720 --> 39:02.490
They're clearly no ordinary adversaries.

39:09.320 --> 39:11.720
As flawless as the disguise technique was,

39:12.320 --> 39:16.780
it could only be the Thousand-Faces Mask
of the Fei's three greatest artifacts.

39:19.450 --> 39:20.930
Back then, Mr. Fei claimed

39:20.930 --> 39:24.060
that the Thousand-Faces Mask was
burned and destroyed.

39:24.280 --> 39:27.370
But I've always had my doubts about that.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.970
I have indeed heard
that this Thousand-Faces Mask

39:29.970 --> 39:32.430
has the miraculous power
to deceive anyone.

39:32.970 --> 39:34.770
If our enemies truly possess it,

39:34.900 --> 39:37.500
it'll be even more difficult
to deal with them.

39:37.840 --> 39:40.680
Desperate times
call for desperate measures.

39:41.640 --> 39:44.370
We don't have much time left.

39:49.680 --> 39:50.280
Suifeng.

39:51.580 --> 39:52.720
Send someone to investigate

39:52.720 --> 39:55.430
whether this matter is related
to the Fei family.

39:55.430 --> 39:55.910
Yes.

39:56.640 --> 39:57.320
Besides,

39:57.770 --> 39:59.430
tell the Ghost King to speed up

39:59.640 --> 40:02.500
and produce more Death Beetles
as soon as possible.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.180
The Ghost King reports

40:04.280 --> 40:05.840
that over the past month,

40:06.280 --> 40:07.880
the Insect King has lost its vitality

40:07.880 --> 40:09.010
and is barely alive.

40:09.020 --> 40:12.680
Only the Heaven-Earth Pool
behind the Insect Valley of the Tang Sect

40:12.680 --> 40:14.010
can revitalize it.

40:14.970 --> 40:17.450
The Tang Sect never allows outsiders
into the Insect Valley.

40:17.450 --> 40:18.850
If we rush in recklessly,

40:19.090 --> 40:21.680
we might hurt the Insect King
and ruin everything.

40:21.680 --> 40:22.970
On the Night of Yin-Hai,

40:22.970 --> 40:24.670
the Tang Sect
will compete for the position of Master,

40:24.670 --> 40:27.400
which might cause them to open
the Insect Valley.

40:27.450 --> 40:29.050
When taking risky measures,

40:29.570 --> 40:31.570
you must be extremely cautious

40:32.490 --> 40:34.420
and must not offend Old Madam Tang.

40:35.690 --> 40:36.420
Understood.

40:36.930 --> 40:38.660
I won't fail your trust, Chief.

40:43.300 --> 40:45.960
Is there still something
you're worried about?

40:46.570 --> 40:48.370
The Wudang Sect, the Shaolin Sect,

40:48.370 --> 40:51.280
and other sects in the martial world are
seeking revenge against us.

40:51.280 --> 40:54.200
Quite a few bases
of the Power Gang have been destroyed.

40:54.200 --> 40:56.120
Now, Zhu the Great King
from the Long River waterways

40:56.120 --> 40:57.720
has suddenly risen to power.

40:58.160 --> 41:01.120
I feel something fishy about this.

41:02.570 --> 41:04.530
The Falconry Whistle probably wants

41:04.530 --> 41:07.730
far more than just to stir up trouble
in the martial world.

41:09.600 --> 41:12.490
This mastermind
wants to challenge our Power Gang.

41:13.680 --> 41:17.640
Then let's see what he's got.
